	(text "- Check if the bulk capacitor is in the right location (near the battery). And only one is needed, because of RF and not MCU (check MCU current).\n- Review the schematic, all connections and components values.\n- Check for leakage currents.\n- For each component ensure it has the link to mouser.\n- For each component ensure it has the foorptint and 3D model.\n- Choose the antenna.\n- Add the antenna via.\n- Generate the boom and check that all components can be purchased and also the final price."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
